 subsequent objection. (2) A manifestation of such assent after the formation of a contract is similarly effective if made for consideration or in circumstances in which a promise would be binding without consideration, or if a material change of position takes place in reliance on the manifestation. § 319 RESTATEMENT OF CONTRACTS—SECOND"